  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Services Projects Process About Blog Contact Overview Buy Rosewood Services Projects Process About Blog Contact [email protected] +00 00 00 00 00 Project External garden path build A durable and visually appealing garden path designed to blend naturally with the landscape while improving accessibility and outdoor flow. Service External Works Location London Duration 1 month Completed November 2025 Before After The Vision The client\u2019s garden was a beautiful space, but the existing path was uneven, cracked, and became slippery when wet. It disconnected the patio from the lower garden area, making it difficult to access the lawn during the wetter months. The goal was to create a durable, safe, and aesthetically pleasing walkway that would invite exploration of the entire garden. Construction Process We began by excavating the old path and preparing a solid sub-base to ensure longevity and prevent future sinking or cracking. Proper drainage was a priority, so we installed a permeable membrane and a gravel soakaway system along the edges. Material Selection Natural Sandstone: We selected Indian Sandstone in \u2018Raj Green\u2019 to complement the existing garden walling and planti",
